{
    "title": "Hoop Land",
    "description": "Get ready for tip off at center court in the latest hoops title by Koality Game! Choose a league, select a team, and build your roster into a champion through the college draft. Dribble the ball up court and cross-over your opponent for the step back three. Swish! Or run a fast break offense and throw the lob to your teammate for the alley-oop. Slam dunk! Either way, you can become the next dynasty in the hottest basketball simulation game on the market. Welcome to Hoop Land.\r\n\r\nFRANCHISE MODE\r\n- Scout and follow the top prospects in college\r\n- Draft or trade your picks to upgrade your roster\r\n- Develop your players and create the greatest dynasty of all time!\r\n\r\nCOMMISSIONER MODE *\r\n- Control all teams or let the CPU make every decision\r\n- Play, spectate, or simulate any game around the league\r\n- Watch your league evolve over an endless amount of seasons!\r\n\r\nCUSTOMIZATION *\r\n- Fully customize leagues, teams, players, awards, and more\r\n- Create your own draft classes to import into Season Mode\r\n- Import or export custom leagues to share with the community!\r\n\r\n* Hoop Land is a PREMIUM game. You are free to download and play unlimited seasons in Franchise Mode but Premium Edition is required to unlock all modes and features. The game contains no ads or other micro-transactions.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get ready for tip off at center court in the latest hoops title by Koality Game! Choose a league, select a team, and build your roster into a champion through the college draft. Dribble the ball up court and cross-over your opponent for the step back three. Swish! Or run a fast break offense and throw the lob to your teammate for the alley-oop. Slam dunk! Either way, you can become the next dynasty in the hottest basketball simulation game on the market. Welcome to Hoop Land.<br><br>FRANCHISE MODE<br>- Scout and follow the top prospects in college<br>- Draft or trade your picks to upgrade your roster<br>- Develop your players and create the greatest dynasty of all time!<br><br>COMMISSIONER MODE *<br>- Control all teams or let the CPU make every decision<br>- Play, spectate, or simulate any game around the league<br>- Watch your league evolve over an endless amount of seasons!<br><br>CUSTOMIZATION *<br>- Fully customize leagues, teams, players, awards, and more<br>- Create your own draft classes to import into Season Mode<br>- Import or export custom leagues to share with the community!<br><br>* Hoop Land is a PREMIUM game. You are free to download and play unlimited seasons in Franchise Mode but Premium Edition is required to unlock all modes and features. The game contains no ads or other micro-transactions.",
